{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-22","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"The square on a medial straight line, if applied to a rational straight line, produces as breadth a straight line rational and incommensurable in length with that to which it is applied.","book":10,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.22/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","contentId":"euclid-10-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be7f6de3982c5bfa47d776ba1867596882a06a739f146c899c4f1eabf13d010f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-22.statement","euclid-10-22.construction.1","euclid-10-22.proof.1","euclid-10-22.construction.2","euclid-10-22.proof.2","euclid-10-22.proof.3","euclid-10-22.proof.4","euclid-10-22.proof.5","euclid-10-22.proof.6","euclid-10-22.proof.7","euclid-10-22.proof.8","euclid-10-22.proof.9","euclid-10-22.conclusion","euclid-10-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c130799641ae4b706e6b21f4adbebbb8381ff30eb82ae3300dc0f13823c7be21","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on a medial straight line, if applied to a rational straight line, produces as breadth a straight line rational and incommensurable in length with that to which it is applied."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形对中项无理线段,如果适用于有理线段,则产生宽度为直线有理和不可公度,长度与直线的长度相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"107f000a6cb0e9f1a6467630d5e1ee414a4b056b38955280fc7ed32a55b642d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be medial and CB rational, and let a rectangular area BD equal to the square on A be applied to BC, producing CD as breadth; I say that CD is rational and incommensurable in length with CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A是中项无理线段和CB 有理,让BC的BD长方形区域适用于BC,宽度扩大为CD;我说CD长为有理和不可公度长为CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13374e22aa81b58fcb2e271dc5e52a86c2af8de3dbffea1f5a0786006dcbe912","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is medial, the square on it is equal to a rectangular area contained by rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A是中项无理线段, 上面的正方形等于有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度的矩形区域。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"703484fff3e8a9c26bfaa9cb3256ca360a9076a49dae881918a73d5104588f26","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the square on it be equal to GF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"上面的正方形等于GF"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e0eeaa6aa40bc4103d716bb9355757d35e554603fd730d68d0ed643aa76c85a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on it is also equal to BD; therefore BD is equal to GF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但上面的正方形也等于BD, 所以BD等于GF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d69cfb2e759fd53e9edc85f8e71ad22e67c4fe2654b39cb29c8b249a36ed4c72","citations":["euclid-6-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also equiangular with it; and in equal and equiangular parallelograms the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)] therefore, proportionally, as BC is to EG, so is EF to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也具有等角;在平等且等角平行四边形中,对角的两边是对等的成比例;因此,BC对EG的比例等于EF对CD的比例；BC 与 EG 之比等于 EF 与 CD 之比。 [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b2bc2f522e19b8bc03ed96e7257133d3e92264cee7c51628eb7d5fc3b2615a4","citations":["euclid-6-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as the square on BC is to the square on EG, so is the square on EF to the square on CD. [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC比正方形的比例与EG比正方形的比例也等于EF比正方形比正方形比CD。 [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd63c21639bff35ed05954fed0318f806e6e7bc07dc5049bee10d92716ac7893","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on CB is commensurable with the square on EG, for each of these straight lines is rational; therefore the square on EF is also commensurable with the square on CD. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CB正方形可公度正方形EG,每条直线有理正方形EF正方形可公度正方形CD正方形可公度正方形号正方形正方形正方形正方形CD正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形EG正方形正方形正方形正方形正方形EG正方形正方形 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfdda0cd47d49e8995af84aad4a1aadce828d03aabe93a70f05600f8e8abc090","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on EF is rational; therefore the square on CD is also rational; [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)] therefore CD is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EF的正方形是有理;CD的正方形也是有理;CD是有理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ce8bc676e8a5ce6c6b3de9c42eb86cb627ef3f023a8edfdc77f1a868e8fcbc3","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since EF is incommensurable in length with EG, for they are commensurable in square only, and, as EF is to EG, so is the square on EF to the rectangle FE, EG, [Lemma] therefore the square on EF is incommensurable with the rectangle FE, EG. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF的长度是不可公度,EG的长度是平方可公度而长度不可公度,而EF的比重是EF的比重是EF的正方形,而矩形的比重是FE的EG,EG的比重是正方形,EG的比重是不可公度的矩形,FE的比重是EG的EG [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4149a21350d493a708ff235e218a03df03e16d16c9dcd183bbe8b03b3721c14c","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on CD is commensurable with the square on EF, for the straight lines are rational in square; and the rectangle DC, CB is commensurable with the rectangle FE, EG, for they are equal to the square on A; therefore the square on CD is also incommensurable with the rectangle DC, CB. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CD的正方形为可公度,EF为正方形,正方形为有理;矩形DCCB为可公度,矩形FEEG为矩形,A为正方形;因此,CD正方形为不可公度,矩形DCCB为不可公度。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"370c341ea7eb5a88cde7c16633120245cb17f3b00fb20915f4e5f988e599d842","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the square on CD is to the rectangle DC, CB, so is DC to CB; [Lemma] therefore DC is incommensurable in length with CB. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CD的正方形是矩形 DC,CB、DC至CB也是如此;因此,[引理]DC的长度为不可公度,CB。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e29e1705a2e5d5f153392de9c847ceebf55aa51e2cefd633e555aed4f1ebcad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD is rational and incommensurable in length with CB. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD是有理个,不可公度个是CB,CB是Q。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-22.source","contentId":"euclid-10-22","revisionId":"euclid-10-22@raw-be7f6de3982c5bfa","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39bd6ca653897c78392eedd2e1481aaac7395da37aa4396a8b5da0c5cef8b6b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.22/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.22\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-22:euclid-10-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-22.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-21","type":"depends_on","prov